      <sparkle:version>16</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Multi-account: the divider and the switch-account hint now show your account&#x27;s login email instead of an opaque id. Pssst remembers each account&#x27;s email after you visit it once in Grok Bot.</p>]]></description>
